
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Meu primeiro site</title>
  <style>
    body {
      background: #101114;
      color: white;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 60px 20px;
    }

    h1 { color: #42e695; }

    button {
      background: #42e695;
      color: #101114;
      border: none;
      padding: 14px 22px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Meu primeiro site!</h1>
  <p>Consegui publicar meu código no GitHub.</p>

  <button onclick="alert('Funcionou perfeitamente! 🚀')">
    Testar botão
  </button>
</body>
</html>
